resources.string:
«Set as wallpaper» hands the file to Android. Android's own wallpaper screen then opens (it belongs to Android, so it is in English) with a preview:
1 — press «Set wallpaper» on it;
2 — if it asks where, choose «Home screen»;
3 — it closes by itself.
That screen opens on every set, for pictures and videos alike — it is what keeps the wallpaper after the car is switched off and on. The explanation shown before it can be switched off with its tick box. If the head unit ever removes the wallpaper (for example after the program was force-closed), the picker offers to put the same one back the next time it opens. Some screens do not support this mode; the option is disabled there automatically.
